# Build context includes static notes, layout sources, the compiler, and nginx config.
# The final image contains only static notes and nginx config.
*
!paper2notes/notes/
!paper2notes/layout/
!paper2notes/scripts/build-books.mjs
!paper2notes/deploy/cloudrun/nginx.conf
!paper2notes/scripts/publish-notes-passages.py
!paper2db/
paper2db/*
!paper2db/metadata/
paper2db/metadata/*
!paper2db/metadata/pointers/
paper2db/metadata/pointers/*
!paper2db/metadata/pointers/notes.json

# Intake/OCR provenance and gitignored local material are never published.
paper2notes/notes/_source/
paper2notes/notes/**/_local/
paper2notes/notes/_local/
**/_local/
**/.DS_Store
paper2notes/active-physics/
paper2notes/dse-classified/
paper2notes/notes/question-notes/
paper2mock/
.git/
.github/
